- **scanning**: expanding rings (radar) — 2-3 rings, each expanding from 0.3 to 1.0 radius with fading opacity, phase-offset; + a center bluetooth dot.
- **connecting**: a rotating arc (270° sweep) — a thin arc rotating around the center; + the same center dot. Slowly it also pulses.
